## MCP - LLM Intention

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/llm-intention

**Description:** Analyse l'intention utilisateur via LLM et propose des actions appropriees.

**InputSchema:**
```json
{
  "required": ["user_id", "guild_id", "user_request", "message"],
  "properties": {
    "user_id": { "type": "string", "description": "ID utilisateur (credits, quotas)" },
    "guild_id": { "type": "string", "description": "ID serveur Discord" },
    "user_request": { "type": "string", "description": "Requete utilisateur originale (contextualise l'analyse)" },
    "message": { "type": "string", "description": "Message a analyser (alias: query)" },
    "context": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "type": { "type": "string", "description": "Domaine: recipe|torah|general" },
        "allowed_actions": { "type": "array", "description": "Actions autorisees" },
        "min_score": { "type": "number", "default": 0.7 },
        "auto_fallback": { "type": "boolean", "default": false }
      }
    },
    "history": { "type": "array", "description": "Historique conversation [{role, content}]" },
    "attached_file": { "type": "object", "description": "Fichier joint {name, type, url}" }
  }
}
```

**Note:** API keys (anthropic_api_key) fournies par le systeme.

**Analyzable:**
```json
{
  "accepts_image": false,
  "accepts_media": false,
  "output_fields": ["intent", "query_analysis", "proposed_actions", "is_relevant"],
  "domain": "nlp"
}
```

